1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"workshop-plan","section":"events","title":["屏南—杭州大路学坊","Pingnan–Hangzhou Big Road Workshop"],"date":"2026.09 / 计划 · Planned","status":["计划资料","Planning record"],"summary":["《原乡社》汇报提出2026年9月的联合教学安排，涉及土耳其及RCA相关人员。具体名单与实际开展情况待补充。","A presentation outlines joint teaching for September 2026 involving participants from Turkey and RCA. Actual participation and delivery remain to be documented."],"chapters":[{"title":["联合教学计划","Joint teaching plan"],"text":["计划以屏南与杭州为教学节点。资料尚不足以确认具体日期、参与人数或完成成果，也不能直接判定它与图书馆任务书属于同一届活动。","Pingnan and Hangzhou are proposed as teaching locations. Exact dates, attendance and outcomes are not yet established, nor is its identity with the library brief."]}],"related":["amend-pingnan","courtyard"],"sources":["keynote"]}}]
